v:"*Kevin Smyth氏発祥の[ハウスルール](https://gamingballistic.com/2020/12/04/df-eastmarch-boss-fight-and-house-rules/)より*"

k:"*From a [house rule](https://github.com/richardwilkes/gcs/pull/393) that uses d3s instead of d6s for damage*"
v:"*ダメージにd6ではなくd3を使う[ハウスルール](https://github.com/richardwilkes/gcs/pull/393)より*"

k:"*From [Adjusting Swing Damage in Dungeon Fantasy](https://noschoolgrognard.blogspot.com/2013/04/adjusting-swing-damage-in-dungeon.html)*"
v:"*[Adjusting Swing Damage in Dungeon Fantasy](https://noschoolgrognard.blogspot.com/2013/04/adjusting-swing-damage-in-dungeon.html)より*"

k:"*From [Alternate Damage Scheme (Thr = Sw-2)](https://github.com/richardwilkes/gcs/issues/97)*"
v:"*[代替ダメージ体系 (Thr = Sw-2)](https://github.com/richardwilkes/gcs/issues/97)より*"

k:"*From [Pyramid 3-83, pages 16-19](PY83:16)*"
v:"*出典: [Pyramid 3-83、16-19ページ](PY83:16)*"

k:"*Option 1 with 2d-2 replaced by 1d+1 and 1d+3 by 2d-1, and likewise for more dice. From [T Bone's Games Diner](https://www.gamesdiner.com/rules-nugget-gurps-new-damage-for-st/)*"
v:"*オプション1の 2d-2 を 1d+1 に、1d+3 を 2d-1 に置き換え、ダイスが増える場合も同様。[T Bone's Games Diner](https://www.gamesdiner.com/rules-nugget-gurps-new-damage-for-st/)より*"

k:"*Option 2 with 2d-2 replaced by 1d+1 and 1d+3 by 2d-1, and likewise for more dice. From [T Bone's Games Diner](https://www.gamesdiner.com/rules-nugget-gurps-new-damage-for-st/)*"
v:"*オプション2の 2d-2 を 1d+1 に、1d+3 を 2d-1 に置き換え、ダイスが増える場合も同様。[T Bone's Games Diner](https://www.gamesdiner.com/rules-nugget-gurps-new-damage-for-st/)より*"

k:"*The standard damage progression*"
v:"*標準のダメージ進行*"

k:"*Thrust is 1d per 10 ST and swing is 3d per 20 ST (1d and 1d+2 at ST 10), the Medium and Large columns from [T Bone's Games Diner](https://www.gamesdiner.com/rules-nugget-gurps-new-damage-for-st/)*"
v:"*突きはST10ごとに1d、振りはST20ごとに3d (ST10で1dと1d+2)。[T Bone's Games Diner](https://www.gamesdiner.com/rules-nugget-gurps-new-damage-for-st/)の中・大の列*"

k:"*Thrust is 1d per 15 ST and swing is 1d per 10 ST (1d-2 and 1d at ST 10), the Small and Medium columns from [T Bone's Games Diner](https://www.gamesdiner.com/rules-nugget-gurps-new-damage-for-st/)*"
v:"*突きはST15ごとに1d、振りはST10ごとに1d (ST10で1d-2と1d)。[T Bone's Games Diner](https://www.gamesdiner.com/rules-nugget-gurps-new-damage-for-st/)の小・中の列*"

